{"result":"ok","response":"collection","data":[{"id":"e900135b-8eba-4d29-85c9-db3d5ae885c7","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"en":"The Ghostly Doctor"},"altTitles":[{"zh-ro":"Gu\u01d0y\u012b F\u00e8ng Ji\u01d4"},{"en":"Mesmerizing Ghost Doctor"},{"zh":"\u9b3c\u533b\u51e4\u4e5d"},{"zh-ro":"Guiyi Feng Jiu"},{"vi":"Thi\u00ean Y Ph\u01b0\u1ee3ng C\u1eedu"}],"description":{"en":"She, the leader of the hidden sect, specializes in poison and assassination. A genius, and a weirdo, in the eyes of others. After dying from an accident, she was reborn in the body of a disfigured lady. Having her identity changed and unable to return to her family, she abandoned them, but, if she doesn't take revenge on those who caused her harm, will she be worthy of the title \"The Ghostly Doctor\"? As clouds gather, heroes fight to be the strongest! How will she conquer the world in a red robe, and fight among the strong heroes?!  \n  \n*The 2 missing chapters are announcements by the author.  \n\n\n---","fr":"Feng Jiu, sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9e dans le poison et l'assassinat, g\u00e9nie ou cingl\u00e9e selon o\u00f9 l'on se place  \nMorte des suites d'un accident, elle rena\u00eet dans le corps d'une femme d\u00e9figur\u00e9e.  \nFeng Qing Ge, trahie par la servante qu'elle a recueillie enfant. Celle-ci lui vole son identit\u00e9, la d\u00e9figure et l'abandonne dans un bordel.  \nElle permet \u00e0 Feng Jiu de rena\u00eetre dans son corps, et avant de mourir lui demande de veiller sur ses parents et d'assouvir sa vengeance. Suivez les aventures de Feng Jiu, le docteur fant\u00f4me !","vi":"N\u00e0ng, \u1ea8n m\u00f4n ch\u1ee7 c\u1ee7a th\u1eddi hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i, tinh th\u00f4ng y \u0111\u1ed9c, gi\u1ecfi \u00e1m s\u00e1t, trong m\u1eaft th\u1ebf nh\u00e2n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1i thi\u00ean t\u00e0i bi\u1ebfn th\u00e1i, m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n ngo\u00e0i \u00fd mu\u1ed1n b\u1ecf m\u00ecnh, l\u1ea1i tr\u1ecdng sinh v\u00e0o m\u1ed9t c\u00e1i thi\u1ebfu n\u1eef b\u1ecb h\u1ee7y dung! Th\u00e2n ph\u1eadn b\u1ecb ho\u00e1n \u0111\u1ed5i? Kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 tr\u1edf v\u1ec1 gia t\u1ed9c? Th\u00e2n ph\u1eadn c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3! Nh\u00e0 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 kh\u00f4ng v\u1ec1! Nh\u01b0ng l\u1ea1i h\u1ea1i ng\u01b0\u1eddi c\u1ee7a n\u00e0ng, t\u1ea1i sao l\u1ea1i kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 b\u00e1o th\u00f9 r\u1eeda h\u1eadn ... th\u1ea5t v\u1ecdng v\u1ec1 Qu\u1ef7 Y? M\u1ed9t khi phong v\u00e2n qu\u1eadt kh\u1edfi, qu\u1ea7n h\u00f9ng tranh b\u00e1! L\u1ea1i nh\u00ecn xem n\u00e0ng m\u1ed9t th\u00e2n h\u1ed3ng y m\u00e0 ngao du thi\u00ean h\u1ea1, g\u01b0\u01a1ng s\u00e1ng x\u01b0ng v\u01b0\u01a1ng n\u01a1i tr\u1eddi cao!","pt-br":"Ela, a l\u00edder da seita oculta, \u00e9 especializada em veneno e assassinato. Uma g\u00eania, e uma esquisita, aos olhos dos outros. Depois de morrer de um acidente, ela renasceu no corpo de uma senhora desfigurada. Tendo sua identidade mudada e incapaz de retornar \u00e0 sua fam\u00edlia, ela os abandonou, mas, se ela n\u00e3o se vingar daqueles que lhe causaram danos, ser\u00e1 ela digna do t\u00edtulo de \"A Doutora Fantasma\"? Enquanto as nuvens se juntam, os her\u00f3is lutam para ser os mais fortes! Como ela conquistar\u00e1 o mundo com um manto vermelho, e lutar\u00e1 entre os her\u00f3is mais fortes?!"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"103582","ap":"mesmerizing-ghost-doctor","kt":"54334","mu":"6i3j2yw","raw":"https:\/\/ac.qq.com\/Comic\/comicInfo\/id\/628719"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"zh","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"661","publicationDemographic":null,"status":"completed","year":2017,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"391b0423-d847-456f-aff0-8b0cfc03066b","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Action"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"3e2b8dae-350e-4ab8-a8ce-016e844b9f0d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Long Strip"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"799c202e-7daa-44eb-9cf7-8a3c0441531e","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Martial Arts"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"87cc87cd-a395-47af-b27a-93258283bbc6","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Adventure"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"9ab53f92-3eed-4e9b-903a-917c86035ee3","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Crossdressing"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"ace04997-f6bd-436e-b261-779182193d3d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Isekai"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"b9af3a63-f058-46de-a9a0-e0c13906197a","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Drama"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"e197df38-d0e7-43b5-9b09-2842d0c326dd","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Web Comic"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"f4122d1c-3b44-44d0-9936-ff7502c39ad3","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Adaptation"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"f5ba408b-0e7a-484d-8d49-4e9125ac96de","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Full Color"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2019-06-28T00:17:04+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-10-15T14:16:20+00:00","version":13,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["en","fr","id","es-la","pt-br","it"],"latestUploadedChapter":"3ead9063-6332-4153-b511-b041b38706de"},"relationships":[{"id":"d73c407f-9ff4-427e-92f6-4c13b6662b3c","type":"author"},{"id":"c2e96a59-417d-4969-a464-880662bb88cb","type":"artist"},{"id":"eb7dc382-83b0-4f4c-9dec-b057235c342d","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":null,"fileName":"9a9fa7b3-df9a-4b74-970e-9853a40e2977.jpg","locale":"zh","createdAt":"2021-05-24T17:16:57+00:00","updatedAt":"2021-05-24T17:16:57+00:00","version":1}}]},{"id":"dc07afaa-643a-4bf4-a9d0-b21ecc101736","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"en":"I Met the Male Lead in Prison"},"altTitles":[{"ko":"\uac10\ubc29\uc5d0\uc11c \ub0a8\uc790\uc8fc\uc778\uacf5\uc744 \ub9cc\ub0ac\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4 (2023)"},{"ko-ro":"Gambangeseo Namjajuingongeul Mannassseubnida (2023)"},{"ko-ro":"Gambang'eseo Namjajuingong'eul Mannassseubnida (2023)"},{"en":"I Met the Male Lead in Prison (2023)"},{"es":"Conoc\u00ed al protagonista masculino en una celda (2023)"},{"ru":"\u042f \u0432\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0435\u0442\u0438\u043b\u0430\u0441\u044c \u0441 \u0433\u043b\u0430\u0432\u043d\u044b\u043c \u0433\u0435\u0440\u043e\u0435\u043c \u0432 \u0442\u044e\u0440\u044c\u043c\u0435 (2023)"},{"th":"\u0e09\u0e31\u0e19\u0e40\u0e08\u0e2d\u0e1e\u0e23\u0e30\u0e40\u0e2d\u0e01\u0e19\u0e34\u0e22\u0e32\u0e22\u0e43\u0e19\u0e2b\u0e49\u0e2d\u0e07\u0e02\u0e31\u0e07"},{"mn":"\u0411\u0438 \u0448\u043e\u0440\u043e\u043d\u0434 \u044d\u0440\u044d\u0433\u0442\u044d\u0439 \u0433\u043e\u043b \u0434\u04af\u0440\u0442\u044d\u0439 \u0443\u0443\u043b\u0437\u0441\u0430\u043d (2023)"},{"ja":"\u76e3\u7344\u3067\u4e3b\u4eba\u516c\u306b\u51fa\u4f1a\u3044\u307e\u3057\u305f"},{"zh":"\u5728\u76d1\u72f1\u6361\u5230\u5fe0\u72ac\u7537\u4e3b (2023)"},{"zh":"\u5728\u76d1\u72f1\u91cc\u9a6f\u670d\u4e86\u5fe0\u72ac\u7cfb\u7537\u4e3b\u4eba\u516c (2023)"},{"zh-hk":"\u7344\u898b\u5fe0\u72ac\u7537\u4e3b\u89d2"}],"description":{"en":"I met the male lead in the prison. I know he's supposed to be a 19+ tragedy novel male lead, but... Why is he like that?\n\n\"Woof! Woof! Woof! Grrr.\"\n\nIt was said that he was cursed to turn into a beast... So, what is it like to awaken from the curse?\n\n\"T-t-take responsibility, or d-don't touch me!\"\n\nI just felt relieved, thinking there wouldn't be any romantic feelings or involvement between me and the male lead.\n\n\"One year later. P-please meet me... on the day I get out of here!\"\n\nMeeting him didn't seem too difficult, so I agreed. So I was released first, but...\n\n**\n\n\u201dCome on in. My lovely little sister who's as charming as the flower.\"\n\nOn the day I was released, the man who approached me turned out to be my brother.\nI was the villain's sister.\n\n\"You went through a lot on my behalf, didn't you? I've been waiting for you.\"\n\n\u2026Fuck. On top of it all, I\u2019m the precious little sister of the villain who is the male lead\u2019s nemesis?\n\n**\n\nThree years later, when we met again, the male lead smiled with a completely different face.\n\n\"Hello, Iyana. I'm going to kidnap you from now on.\""},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"172112","ap":"i-met-the-male-lead-in-prison-hyeseong","mu":"16u9fqe","nu":"i-met-the-male-lead-in-prison","mal":"164385","raw":"https:\/\/page.kakao.com\/content\/62917908?tab_type=about","engtl":"https:\/\/tapas.io\/series\/i-met-the-male-lead-in-prison-comic\/info"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ko","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":null,"status":"ongoing","year":2023,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"0bc90acb-ccc1-44ca-a34a-b9f3a73259d0","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Reincarnation"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"3e2b8dae-350e-4ab8-a8ce-016e844b9f0d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Long Strip"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"423e2eae-a7a2-4a8b-ac03-a8351462d71d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Romance"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"65761a2a-415e-47f3-bef2-a9dababba7a6","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Reverse Harem"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"ace04997-f6bd-436e-b261-779182193d3d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Isekai"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"b9af3a63-f058-46de-a9a0-e0c13906197a","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Drama"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"cdc58593-87dd-415e-bbc0-2ec27bf404cc","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Fantasy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"f4122d1c-3b44-44d0-9936-ff7502c39ad3","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Adaptation"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"f5ba408b-0e7a-484d-8d49-4e9125ac96de","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Full Color"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2023-10-31T16:22:45+00:00","updatedAt":"2025-02-16T14:35:54+00:00","version":14,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["es-la","fr","en","pl"],"latestUploadedChapter":"71a5a6b0-5870-43fb-b5c6-d4e29ec7ddf7"},"relationships":[{"id":"714cd71e-85ad-497b-94f9-3c5c375f2bd4","type":"author"},{"id":"ee9b6a35-c679-4c04-8182-3a135808f0e9","type":"artist"},{"id":"314de0a1-0783-4e86-a3b3-37b5afe21485","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":"1","fileName":"9a73fd90-5e32-4284-b2ed-170119adbb8f.png","locale":"ko","createdAt":"2023-11-02T18:36:57+00:00","updatedAt":"2023-11-02T18:36:57+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"98dedab4-ab4e-4979-8662-5ca5820d2d4e","type":"manga","related":"preserialization"},{"id":"99019635-263a-4ef2-8b40-d2c314388f97","type":"manga","related":"alternate_version"},{"id":"a1641d05-782b-4d9b-aa1e-ff70d6fadca9","type":"creator"}]},{"id":"65208a20-4253-42c8-b0e7-56524bbe795b","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"zh-ro":"X\u012bngji\u01ce H\u00fanji\u00e0ng Zhu\u00e0n"},"altTitles":[{"en":"Legend of Star General"},{"zh":"\u661f\u7532\u9b42\u5c06\u4f20"},{"vi":"Tinh Gi\u00e1p H\u1ed3n T\u01b0\u1edbng"},{"en":"Star Armor Soul Will Pass"}],"description":{"en":"Song Yunxiang, the last Star Soul General of the Human Race, brought the system back to the campus era.  When he was a teenager, he was blinded by the incomplete soul, because he was weak and could only watch his relatives and friends die in front of him.  In this life, he returned with a system rebirth, with 60 years of combat experience and knowledge and technology, and returned to school. From then on, he used to build mechas to fight monsters... The things that have regretted, the people who have missed, this time will not leave regrets.","zh":"\u4eba\u65cf\u6700\u540e\u4e00\u4f4d\u661f\u9b42\u5e08\u5b8b\u4e91\u7965\uff0c\u5e26\u7740\u7cfb\u7edf\u91cd\u751f\u56de\u6821\u56ed\u65f6\u4ee3\u3002 \u5c11\u5e74\u65f6\u66fe\u56e0\u4e3a\u9b42\u8109\u6b8b\u7f3a\u906d\u4eba\u767d\u773c\uff0c\u56e0\u4e3a\u5f31\u5c0f\u53ea\u80fd\u773c\u7741\u7741\u770b\u7740\u4eb2\u53cb\u6218\u6b7b\u5728\u81ea\u5df1\u8eab\u524d\u3002 \u8fd9\u4e00\u4e16\uff0c\u5e26\u7740\u7cfb\u7edf\u91cd\u751f\u5f52\u6765\uff0c\u62e5\u6709\u516d\u5341\u5e74\u7684\u6218\u6597\u7ecf\u9a8c\u548c\u77e5\u8bc6\u6280\u672f\uff0c\u91cd\u8fd4\u6821\u56ed\uff0c\u4ece\u6b64\u4e00\u8def\u5f00\u6302\u9020\u673a\u7532\u6253\u602a\u517d\u2026 \u66fe\u7ecf\u540e\u6094\u7684\u4e8b\uff0c\u66fe\u7ecf\u9519\u8fc7\u7684\u4eba\uff0c\u8fd9\u4e00\u6b21\u5c06\u4e0d\u7559\u9057\u61be\u3002"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"160500","mu":"khs3j47","raw":"https:\/\/ac.qq.com\/Comic\/comicInfo\/id\/651472"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"zh","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":"shounen","status":"ongoing","year":2021,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"256c8bd9-4904-4360-bf4f-508a76d67183","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Sci-Fi"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"292e862b-2d17-4062-90a2-0356caa4ae27","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Time Travel"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"391b0423-d847-456f-aff0-8b0cfc03066b","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Action"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"3e2b8dae-350e-4ab8-a8ce-016e844b9f0d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Long Strip"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"50880a9d-5440-4732-9afb-8f457127e836","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Mecha"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"b9af3a63-f058-46de-a9a0-e0c13906197a","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Drama"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"e197df38-d0e7-43b5-9b09-2842d0c326dd","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Web Comic"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"f5ba408b-0e7a-484d-8d49-4e9125ac96de","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Full Color"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2021-12-11T19:53:08+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-03T00:04:52+00:00","version":12,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["en","pt-br","id"],"latestUploadedChapter":"151ab3a5-29b4-4dc9-a147-56ee5930edf3"},"relationships":[{"id":"284e5dee-0152-4803-a674-3838ad217b3c","type":"author"},{"id":"3ebf8ac6-201a-4b3a-aa09-3d589ef7d936","type":"author"},{"id":"284e5dee-0152-4803-a674-3838ad217b3c","type":"artist"},{"id":"3ebf8ac6-201a-4b3a-aa09-3d589ef7d936","type":"artist"},{"id":"448bdc33-156e-4057-b086-8e51a44077c4","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":"1","fileName":"09bcbce1-aa28-4f81-8807-2d8db942cb1a.png","locale":"zh","createdAt":"2022-12-04T12:43:49+00:00","updatedAt":"2022-12-04T12:43:49+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"42751bc4-c046-411b-8d34-68dca266ce61","type":"manga","related":"shared_universe"},{"id":"18defef1-afee-4f15-831c-aff4a090f275","type":"creator"}]},{"id":"bd2d67e4-04d4-47ca-931e-5726f2199f55","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Shiori-san wa Temahima Kakaru Mirai-nin"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u30b7\u30aa\u30ea\u3055\u3093\u306f\u624b\u9593\u6687\u304b\u304b\u308b\u672a\u6765\u4eba"},{"en":"Shiori is a Quite Demanding Girl from the Future"}],"description":{"en":"\"Shelter me!\"\n\nOgata, an ordinary college student, finds himself singled out by Shiori, a beautiful girl who claims to be from the future. Shackled by a mysterious pair of handcuffs, he is forced to live with her... But this girl from the future doesn't do a thing!","ja":"\u300e\u50d5\u3092\u533f\u3063\u3066\u304f\u308c\uff01\u300f\n\n\u5e73\u51e1\u306a\u5927\u5b66\u751f\u30aa\u30ac\u30bf\u306f\u3001\u81ea\u5206\u3092\u672a\u6765\u4eba\u3068\u81ea\u79f0\u3059\u308b\u7f8e\u5c11\u5973\u30fb\u30b7\u30aa\u30ea\u306b\u306a\u305c\u304b\u76ee\u3092\u4ed8\u3051\u3089\u308c\u308b\u3002\u30b7\u30aa\u30ea\u306b\u3088\u3063\u3066\u3001\u4e0d\u601d\u8b70\u306a\u624b\u9320\u306b\u7e4b\u304c\u308c\u305f\u30aa\u30ac\u30bf\u306f\u3001\u540c\u5c45\u751f\u6d3b\u3092\u4f59\u5100\u306a\u304f\u3055\u308c\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3046\u304c...\u3053\u306e\u672a\u6765\u4eba\u3001\u306a\u3093\u306b\u3082\u3057\u306a\u3044...!"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"bl":"20169926","bw":"series\/579216","mu":"0gt591r","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/dp\/B0GQCDFGJT","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/962074\/","mal":"196662","raw":"https:\/\/comic-walker.com\/detail\/KC_007131_S"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":"seinen","status":"ongoing","year":2025,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":[{"id":"423e2eae-a7a2-4a8b-ac03-a8351462d71d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Romance"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"b11fda93-8f1d-4bef-b2ed-8803d3733170","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"4-Koma"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2026-03-14T12:07:26+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-10-22T08:40:28+00:00","version":5,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["en"],"latestUploadedChapter":"68019494-9d16-41e3-ba9d-7a49c54215f1"},"relationships":[{"id":"2fa3c5f5-e3fb-4a63-96e8-9d8f9859b3b8","type":"author"},{"id":"2fa3c5f5-e3fb-4a63-96e8-9d8f9859b3b8","type":"artist"},{"id":"f8e72e93-f52d-4094-9d9c-f680667f18ee","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":"2","fileName":"e4e7c8d6-e681-4c71-9e17-468f87dddd44.jpg","locale":"ja","createdAt":"2026-10-22T08:41:18+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-10-22T08:41:18+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"27bde0e8-71b0-4bf2-8e25-2902a7b2dd4b","type":"creator"}]},{"id":"a6e82c3e-a6ce-4897-be53-a0044c5cd469","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"en":"Acro Trip"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u30a2\u30af\u30ed\u30c8\u30ea\u30c3\u30d7"},{"ja-ro":"acro trip"}],"description":{"en":"Chizuko, who lives in Sakai City, Niigata Prefecture, is an otaku girl who is a big fan of the magical girl Berry Blossom who protects the city against the evil organisation Fossa Magna. However, nobody was worried about the battle of the two anymore because, Chroma, the wicked evil villain, was too sloppy.\n\nSo Chizuko decided \u201cI want to make my magical girl shine more\u2026!\u201d That desire (?) Leads a shy junior high school student to a strange evil path\u2026"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"114430","bw":"series\/156686\/list","kt":"acro-trip","mu":"p7eqpln","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/dp\/B07X8YWLNL","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/454023","mal":"114066","raw":"https:\/\/shonenjumpplus.com\/episode\/3270375685330789621"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"5","lastChapter":"70","publicationDemographic":"shoujo","status":"completed","year":2017,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"81c836c9-914a-4eca-981a-560dad663e73","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Magical Girls"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"a1f53773-c69a-4ce5-8cab-fffcd90b1565","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Magic"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2022-10-21T18:15:08+00:00","updatedAt":"2025-01-27T20:01:21+00:00","version":17,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["en"],"latestUploadedChapter":"99b9160f-c0c7-4718-a4f6-e215d8427150"},"relationships":[{"id":"8487c339-9439-4f90-af41-e7ebc2d6d95e","type":"author"},{"id":"8487c339-9439-4f90-af41-e7ebc2d6d95e","type":"artist"},{"id":"7bb7945d-54dc-42fd-af3e-c80279243153","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"Format: Digital\nImprint: Ribon Mascot Comics\nPublisher: Shueisha\nYear: 2018","volume":"5.1","fileName":"7529ac22-ca49-4db6-bd04-a6711573ba05.jpg","locale":"ja","createdAt":"2024-10-13T09:03:28+00:00","updatedAt":"2025-01-01T14:46:51+00:00","version":2}},{"id":"d8e53234-d828-4cf1-be1a-d2070c960176","type":"creator"}]},{"id":"1bfbb8cf-96ea-416e-b211-656a9eb04a57","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Kyou kara Tsukaeru Isekai Ren'ai Manual"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u4eca\u65e5\u304b\u3089\u4f7f\u3048\u308b\u7570\u4e16\u754c\u604b\u611b\u30de\u30cb\u30e5\u30a2\u30eb"},{"en":"A Love Manual You Can Use from Today"},{"es-la":"Manual de romance para otro mundo"},{"pt-br":"Um manual de amor que voc\u00ea pode usar em outro mundo"}],"description":{"en":"\"I like you. Please go out with me!\"\n\nJust as Haruchika Isezaki confesses to his first love, he is suddenly summoned to another world. His summoner, the goddess Clemontine, gives him an unusual mission \u2013 to make seven girls, destined to become the mothers of the next generation of heroes, fall in love again. These girls have lost their ability to love due to a curse cast by the Demon King. In other words, Haruchika must make them fall for him!\n\nTo return to his world and hear the answer to his confession, Haruchika accepts this mission and sets out to save another world through love. Having mastered the art of romance through psychology and become a Love Master, his journey to fulfill his first love begins now.","ja":"\u7247\u601d\u3044\u306e\u76f8\u624b\u306b\u60f3\u3044\u3092\u4f1d\u3048\u308b\u70ba\u306b\u604b\u611b\u306b\u307e\u3064\u308f\u308b\u3042\u3089\u3086\u308b\u77e5\u8b58\u3092\u8eab\u306b\u7740\u3051\u305f\u4f0a\u52e2\u5d0e\u6625\u89aa\u306f\u3001\u4e00\u4e16\u4e00\u4ee3\u306e\u544a\u767d\u306e\u77ac\u9593\u306b\u7570\u4e16\u754c\u3078\u3068\u53ec\u559a\u3055\u308c\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3046\u3002\u6625\u89aa\u304c\u53ec\u559a\u3055\u308c\u305f\u306e\u306f\u3001\u546a\u3044\u306b\u3088\u3063\u3066\u604b\u5fc3\u3092\u596a\u308f\u308c\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3063\u305f\u300c\uff13\uff10\u5e74\u5f8c\u306b\u9b54\u738b\u3092\u5012\u3059\u52c7\u8005\u30d1\u30fc\u30c6\u30a3\u306e\u30e1\u30f3\u30d0\u30fc\u306e\u6bcd\u3068\u306a\u308b\uff17\u4eba\u306e\u5c11\u5973\u305f\u3061\u300d\u306b\u604b\u5fc3\u3092\u53d6\u308a\u623b\u3059\u70ba\u3067\u3042\u3063\u305f\u3002\u30e9\u30d6\u30de\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u30fb\u6625\u89aa\u306f\u8eab\u306b\u7740\u3051\u305f\u604b\u611b\u306e\u30b9\u30ad\u30eb\u3092\u99c6\u4f7f\u3057\u3066\u3001\u5c11\u5973\u305f\u3061\u3092\u6551\u3046\u4e8b\u304c\u51fa\u6765\u308b\u306e\u304b\uff1f","es-la":"\"Me gustas. Por favor, sal conmigo...\" Mientras el protagonista, Haruchika Isezaki, confiesa su amor a su primer amor, es convocado repentinamente a otro mundo. La invocadora es la diosa Clementine, quien le asigna una misi\u00f3n peculiar: \u00a1hacer que se enamoren de \u00e9l las siete chicas que han perdido la capacidad de amar debido a la maldici\u00f3n del Rey Demonio! Estas chicas est\u00e1n destinadas a convertirse en las madres de la pr\u00f3xima generaci\u00f3n de h\u00e9roes. En otras palabras, su tarea es lograr que todas se enamoren de \u00e9l.\nCon la esperanza de regresar a su mundo y escuchar la respuesta a su confesi\u00f3n, Haruchika acepta la misi\u00f3n. As\u00ed comienza una historia de amor y salvaci\u00f3n en otro mundo, protagonizada por un hombre que, para hacer realidad su primer amor, estudi\u00f3 toda la psicolog\u00eda del amor y se convirti\u00f3 en un maestro en el arte del romance. \u00a1La aventura comienza ahora!","pt-br":"\"Eu gosto de voc\u00ea. Por favor, saia comigo!\"\n\nJusto quando Haruchika Isezaki confessa seus sentimentos ao seu primeiro amor, ele \u00e9 repentinamente invocado para outro mundo. A respons\u00e1vel por sua invoca\u00e7\u00e3o, a deusa Clemontine, lhe d\u00e1 uma miss\u00e3o incomum: fazer com que sete garotas, destinadas a se tornar as m\u00e3es da pr\u00f3xima gera\u00e7\u00e3o de her\u00f3is, se apaixonem novamente. Essas garotas perderam a capacidade de amar devido a uma maldi\u00e7\u00e3o lan\u00e7ada pelo Rei Dem\u00f4nio. Em outras palavras, Haruchika precisa fazer com que elas se apaixonem por ele!\n\nPara retornar ao seu mundo e ouvir a resposta \u00e0 sua confiss\u00e3o, Haruchika aceita a miss\u00e3o e parte para salvar outro mundo atrav\u00e9s do amor. Ap\u00f3s dominar a arte do romance por meio da psicologia e se tornar um Mestre do Amor, sua jornada para conquistar seu primeiro amor come\u00e7a agora."},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"186898","ap":"kyou-kara-tsukaeru-isekai-renai-manyuaru","bl":"20121652","bw":"series\/517532","kt":"74326","mu":"jtpst6q","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/dp\/B0F2JJ2F82","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/886467","mal":"189427","raw":"https:\/\/manga.nicovideo.jp\/comic\/70799"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":"seinen","status":"ongoing","year":2024,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":[{"id":"391b0423-d847-456f-aff0-8b0cfc03066b","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Action"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"3b60b75c-a2d7-4860-ab56-05f391bb889c","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Psychological"},"description":{},"gr