Club des fl\u00e2neurs"},{"ar":"\u064a\u0648\u0645 \u062c\u064a\u062f \u0644\u0644\u0639\u0648\u062f\u0629 \u0625\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0646\u0632\u0644"}],"description":{"en":"Shun was the star of his middle school's soccer team, until an injury forced him to give up on his dream. Now in high school, he\u2019s adrift, with no real interests or passions\u2026 until he meets his oddball upperclassman Naoki. She ropes him into joining her unofficial \u201cHyper-Epic Heading Home Club\u201d, a club with only one member dedicated to turning every walk home into an adventure. As Shun follows Naoki through her flights of fancy in search of elaborate detours, secret treasures, and anything else that catches her attention, can the Heading Home Club bring color back to his drab everyday life? (Omoi)","ja":"\u30b5\u30c3\u30ab\u30fc\u306e\u9053\u3067\u5c06\u6765\u3092\u5631\u671b\u3055\u308c\u305f\u4f50\u85e4\u77ac\u306f\u3001\u30b1\u30ac\u304c\u539f\u56e0\u3067\u5922\u3092\u65ad\u5ff5\u3002\u306a\u3093\u306e\u5e0c\u671b\u3082\u898b\u3044\u3060\u305b\u306a\u3044\u307e\u307e\u9ad8\u6821\uff11\u5e74\u751f\u306b\u306a\u3063\u305f\u3002\u305d\u3053\u3067\u51fa\u4f1a\u3063\u305f\u306e\u306f\u300c\u5e30\u308a\u305f\u3044\u300d\u304c\u53e3\u7656\u306e\u4f50\u85e4\u76f4\u5e0c\u3002\u901a\u79f0\u300c\u76f4\u5e30\u3061\u3083\u3093\u300d\u3002\u5165\u90e8\u3057\u305f\u3044\u306a\u3093\u3066\u4e00\u5ea6\u3082\u8a00\u3063\u3066\u306a\u3044\u306e\u306b\u3001\u534a\u3070\u5f37\u5f15\u306a\u5f62\u3067\u306a\u3093\u3068\u3082\u602a\u3057\u3044\u201c\u30cf\u30a4\u30d1\u30fc\u5e30\u5b85\u90e8\u201d\u306e\u6d3b\u52d5\u306b\u53c2\u52a0\u3059\u308b\u30cf\u30e1\u306b\u306a\u3063\u305f\u77ac\u306f\u3001\u76f4\u5e30\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306b\u632f\u308a\u56de\u3055\u308c\u306a\u304c\u3089\u3001\u5c11\u3057\u305a\u3064\u6bce\u65e5\u304c\u8272\u3065\u3044\u3066\u3044\u304f\u3053\u3068\u3092\u5b9f\u611f\u3057\u3066\u3044\u304f\u3002","tl":"Inimbitahan si Shun sa Klab ng Uwian ni Naoki Satou, na kilala rin bilang \"Chokki-chan\". Kahit na tumanggi siya, napasama pa rin siya sa mga gawain ng klab sa medyo pilit na paraan! Isang romantikong komedya tungkol sa Klab ng Uwian na tampok ang isang hayskul na dalaga na mahilig maglibot at isang bagong estudyante sa hayskul na nawalan ng pangarap.","tr":"Shun, \"Chokki-chan\" olarak da bilinen Naoki Satou taraf\u0131ndan Eve Gitme Kul\u00fcb\u00fc'ne davet edildi. Teklifi reddetmesine ra\u011fmen kul\u00fcb\u00fcn etkinliklerine biraz zorlamayla dahil olmak zorunda kal\u0131r! Yoldayken farkl\u0131 yerlere u\u011framay\u0131 seven bir liseli k\u0131z\u0131n ve hayallerini kaybetmi\u015f bir liseli erke\u011fin Eve Gitme Kul\u00fcb\u00fc'ndeki romantik komedili maceralar\u0131na kat\u0131l\u0131n.","es-la":"Shun fue invitado al Club de Irse a Casa por Naoki Satou, tambi\u00e9n conocida como \"Chokki-chan\". A pesar de negarse, acaba involucr\u00e1ndose a la fuerza en las actividades del club. Una comedia rom\u00e1ntica del Club de Irse a Casa protagonizada por una chica de preparatoria amante de los desv\u00edos y un nuevo estudiante de preparatoria que ha perdido su sue\u00f1o.","pt-br":"Shun foi convidado para o Clube v\u00e1-para casa por Naoki Satou, tamb\u00e9m conhecido como \"Chokki-chan\". Apesar de recusar, ele acaba se envolvendo de alguma forma nas atividades do clube! Uma com\u00e9dia rom\u00e2ntica do Clube v\u00e1-para casa apresentando uma colegial amante de desvios e um novo aluno do ensino m\u00e9dio que perdeu seu sonho."},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"173062","ap":"houkago-kitaku-biyori","bl":"20073887","bw":"series\/455662\/list","kt":"70966","mu":"1210hao","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/dp\/B0CQKJZX8K","cdj":"https:\/\/www.cdjapan.co.jp\/product\/NEOBK-2929413","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/809808\/","mal":"165876","raw":"https:\/\/comic-action.com\/episode\/4856001361584756651","engtl":"https:\/\/www.omoi.com\/series\/walking-home-with-you"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":"seinen","status":"ongoing","year":2023,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"423e2eae-a7a2-4a8b-ac03-a8351462d71d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Romance"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"caaa44eb-cd40-4177-b930-79d3ef2afe87","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"School Life"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"e5301a23-ebd9-49dd-a0cb-2add944c7fe9","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Slice of Life"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2024-01-05T02:35:47+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-09-11T19:17:46+00:00","version":74,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["es-la","id","vi","tl","en","ru","pt-br"],"latestUploadedChapter":"a5f33b91-80c9-4b0d-a77a-60c104252621"},"relationships":[{"id":"dade3bf2-d8e1-4432-8cf6-6bcb6a386523","type":"author"},{"id":"dade3bf2-d8e1-4432-8cf6-6bcb6a386523","type":"artist"},{"id":"bf543672-aa44-4e91-90fe-951d61e543c3","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":"7","fileName":"4f2b076f-4b47-465e-95fb-5a14baf1f0a6.jpg","locale":"ja","createdAt":"2026-10-02T14:35:51+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-10-02T14:35:51+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"fe9c8430-52cf-4173-a87d-89a786fbeb49","type":"creator"}]},{"id":"b28525ae-ef8a-47aa-a120-5917a351be2d","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Kemutai Hanashi"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u7159\u305f\u3044\u8a71"},{"ko":"\ub9e4\uce90\ud55c \uc774\uc57c\uae30"},{"fr":"Vies d'ensemble - Au-del\u00e0 des mots (naBan)"}],"description":{"en":"Takeda and Arita haven't met since their high school graduation, but after taking in an abandoned cat one rainy day, their relationship begins to change. It's not romantic love. They don't have a reason to live together. And yet, they still want to be by each other's side. Faced with these feelings, the answer they decide on is...\n\nA slice of life manga series about trying to break free from the urge to label relationships a certain way.\n___\nNote: Nominated for the 2022 Next Manga Award (Tsugi ni Kuru Manga Taishou) for Best Web Manga.","ja":"\u9ad8\u6821\u5352\u696d\u4ee5\u6765\u3001\u4e00\u5ea6\u3082\u4f1a\u3046\u3053\u3068\u306e\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f\u6b66\u7530\u3068\u6709\u7530\u3002\u3042\u308b\u96e8\u306e\u65e5\u306b\u4e00\u5339\u306e\u732b\u3092\u62fe\u3063\u305f\u3053\u3068\u304b\u3089\u3001\u4e8c\u4eba\u306e\u95a2\u4fc2\u306f\u5909\u308f\u308a\u59cb\u3081\u308b\u3002\u604b\u611b\u611f\u60c5\u3068\u306f\u9055\u3046\u3002\u4e00\u7dd2\u306b\u66ae\u3089\u3059\u7406\u7531\u3082\u306a\u3044\u3002\u3067\u3082\u3001\u541b\u306e\u96a3\u306f\u5fc3\u5730\u304c\u3044\u3044\u3002\u305d\u3093\u306a\u6c17\u6301\u3061\u306b\u5411\u304d\u5408\u3044\u3001\u4e8c\u4eba\u304c\u51fa\u3057\u305f\u7b54\u3048\u3068\u306f\u2015\u2015\u3002"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"155108","ap":"kemutai-hanashi","bl":"1231334","bw":"series\/379285\/list","kt":"70527","mu":"imnfsjy","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/dp\/B0BKLS86PN","cdj":"https:\/\/www.cdjapan.co.jp\/product\/NEOBK-2902378","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/723905","mal":"151714","raw":"https:\/\/www.comicnettai.com\/book\/9"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":"seinen","status":"ongoing","year":2022,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"b9af3a63-f058-46de-a9a0-e0c13906197a","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Drama"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"e5301a23-ebd9-49dd-a0cb-2add944c7fe9","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Slice of Life"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNum