:"27bde0e8-71b0-4bf2-8e25-2902a7b2dd4b","type":"creator"}]},{"id":"3e11f43e-3d91-47c8-a2ad-e2f23d36ad4c","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"en":"Mimi"},"altTitles":[],"description":{"en":"Her name is Mimi, she's a completely normal and well adjusted human being.\n**This is her story.**","es":"Su nombre es Mimi, y es una persona completamente normal y equilibrada.\n**Esta es su historia.**","fr":"Elle s'appelle Mimi, c'est une personne tout \u00e0 fait normale et \u00e9quilibr\u00e9e.\n\nVoici son histoire.","tr":"Bu k\u0131z\u0131l g\u00f6zl\u00fc k\u0131z\u0131m\u0131z\u0131n ismi Mimi. O, **tamamen** normal bir insan.\nVe bu seriyse onun g\u00fcnl\u00fck hayat\u0131nda ya\u015fad\u0131\u011f\u0131 olaylar\u0131n karikat\u00fcr\u00fc.","es-la":"Su nombre es Mimi, y es una persona completamente normal y equilibrada.\n**Esta es su historia.**","pt-br":"O nome dela \u00e9 Mimi, ela \u00e9 um ser humano completamente normal e bem ajustado.\n**Esta \u00e9 a hist\u00f3ria dela.**"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"kt":"mimi","raw":"https:\/\/twitter.com\/Nhim_Art","engtl":"https:\/\/vastmanga.com\/mimi-volume-1\/"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"en","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":null,"status":"ongoing","year":2024,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":[{"id":"3b60b75c-a2d7-4860-ab56-05f391bb889c","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Psychological"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"3de8c75d-8ee3-48ff-98ee-e20a65c86451","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Animals"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"423e2eae-a7a2-4a8b-ac03-a8351462d71d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Romance"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"891cf039-b895-47f0-9229-bef4c96eccd4","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Self-Published"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"e197df38-d0e7-43b5-9b09-2842d0c326dd","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Web Comic"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"e5301a23-ebd9-49dd-a0cb-2add944c7fe9","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Slice of Life"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2025-11-18T13:16:48+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-13T16:36:47+00:00","version":15,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["pt-br","en","fr","tr","vi","sl","es-la","ru","id","tl","pl"],"latestUploadedChapter":"60906ed8-8a73-4fd0-944f-10d8427c661f"},"relationships":[{"id":"730c8b65-fabf-4db4-86c6-34ca983a64a4","type":"author"},{"id":"730c8b65-fabf-4db4-86c6-34ca983a64a4","type":"artist"},{"id":"7d375c5c-5e76-4289-9351-d42e680e8ddf","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":"3","fileName":"81904858-24a3-456c-bd03-29eba093645b.png","locale":"en","createdAt":"2026-08-11T15:53:31+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-08-11T15:53:31+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"86047743-57b8-4938-9750-07ebf001605a","type":"creator"}]},{"id":"7e3d081f-30f2-475d-83bb-e247cffea3d6","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Isshiki-san wa Koi o Shiritai."},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u4e00\u5f0f\u3055\u3093\u306f\u604b\u3092\u77e5\u308a\u305f\u3044\u3002"},{"en":"Isshiki-san Wants to Know About Love."},{"en":"Fullmetal Rinna Wants to XX"},{"zh":"\u94a2\u94c1\u76f4\u5973\u60f3\u88abxx"},{"zh-hk":"\u92fc\u9435\u7684\u7433\u5a1c\u60f3\u88abxx"},{"zh-hk":"\u4e00\u5f0f\u5c0f\u59d0\u60f3\u8981\u77e5\u66c9\u6200\u611b\u3002"},{"zh-ro":"G\u0101ngti\u011b zh\u00ed n\u01da xi\u01ceng b\u00e8i xx"},{"zh-ro":"Y\u012bsh\u00ec xi\u01ceoji\u011b xi\u01ceng y\u00e0o zh\u012bxi\u01ceo li\u00e0n'\u00e0i."},{"pt-br":"Isshiki-san quer entender o amor"},{"vi":"Isshiki-san mu\u1ed1n bi\u1ebft y\u00eau l\u00e0 g\u00ec"}],"description":{"en":"A maiden who doesn't know what love is tries her hand at dating as a pseudo-couple!\n\nInspector Rinna, who is respected by everyone as a hard-working and serious policewoman, seems to be having trouble with her work lately. The reason for this is because she loses focus. It only happens when Meishi, the detective she works with, is around... So, she makes a choice...?","ja":"\u5805\u7269\u3067\u771f\u9762\u76ee\u306a\u8b66\u5bdf\u5b98\u3060\u3068\u5468\u308a\u304b\u3089\u5c0a\u656c\u3055\u308c\u3066\u3044\u308b\u4e00\u5f0f\u8b66\u90e8\u306f\u3001\u6700\u8fd1\u3069\u3046\u3082\u4ed5\u4e8b\u304c\u3046\u307e\u304f\u3044\u304b\u306a\u3044\u3054\u69d8\u5b50\u3002\u305d\u306e\u539f\u56e0\u306f\u4e00\u7dd2\u306b\u4ed5\u4e8b\u3092\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u63a2\u5075\u30fb\u516d\u53cd\u7530\u304c\u3044\u308b\u6642\u306b\u3070\u304b\u308a\u8d77\u3053\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3046\u2026\u3002\u305d\u3053\u3067\u5f7c\u5973\u304c\u3068\u3063\u305f\u9078\u629e\u304c\u2026\uff1f","pt-br":"Uma donzela que n\u00e3o sabe o que \u00e9 o amor, experimenta o namoro como um pseudo-casal!\n\nA inspectora Rinna, que \u00e9 respeitada por todos como uma agente policial trabalhadora e s\u00e9ria, parece estar a ter problemas com o seu trabalho ultimamente. A raz\u00e3o para isto \u00e9 porque ela perde o foco. Isto s\u00f3 acontece quando Meishi, o detective com quem ela trabalha, est\u00e1 por perto. Ent\u00e3o, ela faz uma escolha\u2026?"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"120945","ap":"isshiki-san-wa-koi-wo-shiritai","bl":"20029686","bw":"series\/281750\/list","kt":"65037","mu":"88t325s","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/dp\/B0976NGCH9","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/618757","mal":"137313","raw":"https:\/\/web-ace.jp\/shonenace\/contents\/469","engtl":"https:\/\/yenpress.com\/series\/isshiki-san-wants-to-know-about-love"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":"shounen",