-ro":"Femme Fatale no Kyuusai"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u30d5\u30a1\u30e0\u30fb\u30d5\u30a1\u30bf\u30fc\u30eb\u306e\u6551\u6e08"},{"en":"Femme fatale's Salvation"}],"description":{"en":"Haruhisa Tajima is a novelist who has been unable to write anything new for some time due to writer's block.\n\nOne day, he meets a college student named Shino Miyama. She casually makes herself at home in Tajima's house and offers to take care of his daily needs.\n\nUnable to figure out her true intentions, Tajima nevertheless accepts her offer, his curiosity as a novelist outweighing his reservations. Shino acts as though she knows exactly who he is, confidently declaring, \"I want to be of use to you, Sensei.\"\n\nWhat lies hidden in the depths of those jet-black eyes of hers...?\n___\n- Alt Official Raw: [niconico manga](https:\/\/manga.nicovideo.jp\/comic\/85951?track=official_trial_l2)","ja":"\u30b9\u30e9\u30f3\u30d7\u3067\u3053\u3053\u3057\u3070\u3089\u304f\u65b0\u4f5c\u304c\u66f8\u3051\u3066\u3044\u306a\u3044\u5c0f\u8aac\u5bb6\u306e\u7530\u5d8b\u6674\u4e45\u3002\n\u3042\u308b\u65e5\u3001\u6df1\u5c71\u5fd7\u4e43\u3068\u540d\u4e57\u308b\u5973\u5b50\u5927\u751f\u3068\u51fa\u4f1a\u3046\u3002\n\u5fd7\u4e43\u306f\u5f53\u7136\u306e\u3088\u3046\u306b\u7530\u5d8b\u306e\u5bb6\u306b\u4e0a\u304c\u308a\u8fbc\u307f\u3001\u8eab\u306e\u56de\u308a\u306e\u4e16\u8a71\u3092\u8cb7\u3063\u3066\u51fa\u308b\u3002\n\u7530\u5d8b\u306f\u3001\u5f7c\u5973\u306e\u771f\u610f\u3092\u6e2c\u308a\u304b\u306d\u306a\u304c\u3089\u3082\u5c0f\u8aac\u5bb6\u3068\u3057\u3066\u306e\u597d\u5947\u5fc3\u304c\u52dd\u308a\u3001\u305d\u308c\u3092\u53d7\u3051\u5165\u308c\u308b\u3002\n\u307e\u308b\u3067\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u7d20\u6027\u3092\u77e5\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u304b\u306e\u3088\u3046\u306a\u7acb\u3061\u5c45\u632f\u308b\u821e\u3044\u3092\u3059\u308b\u5fd7\u4e43\u3001\u300c\u5148\u751f\u306e\u5f79\u306b\u7acb\u3061\u305f\u3044\u300d\u3068\u8a00\u3044\u5207\u308b\u6f06\u9ed2\u306e\u77b3\u306e\u5965\u306b\u7530\u5d8b\u304c\u898b\u305f\u3082\u306e\u306f\u2015\u2015\u3002"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"218734","ap":"femme-fatale-no-kyuusa","mu":"tqkmfmf","mal":"197341","raw":"https:\/\/comic-walker.com\/detail\/KC_020745_S"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":"seinen","status":"ongoing","year":2026,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":[{"id":"07251805-a27e-4d59-b488-f0bfbec15168","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Thriller"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"3b60b75c-a2d7-4860-ab56-05f391bb889c","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Psychological"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"b9af3a63-f058-46de-a9a0-e0c13906197a","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Drama"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"ee968100-4191-4968-93d3-f82d72be7e46","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Mystery"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2026-10-22T18:23:18+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-04T02:42:42+00:00","version":13,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["es-la","id","pt-br","en","vi"],"latestUploadedChapter":"c6f898f3-a173-400a-9a92-9971aa6667b5"},"relationships":[{"id":"9c80ce77-39fd-4c99-90da-042db323d844","type":"author"},{"id":"9c80ce77-39fd-4c99-90da-042db323d844","type":"artist"},{"id":"63279907-046c-4f01-bdde-cae88cccd799","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":"0","fileName":"13a34493-06c0-4fc0-8f27-8cd8f9e44fa0.png","locale":"ja","createdAt":"2026-10-22T18:23:20+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-10-22T18:34:11+00:00","version":2}},{"id":"df5d2b1c-f6b6-4f7a-9f98-3678004ed8e8","type":"creator"}]},{"id":"fc7e628c-6c26-497a-b17d-dfea90b44652","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Bocchi no Boku ni Kyousei Kanojo ga Yattekita"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u307c\u3063\u3061\u306e\u50d5\u306b\u5f37\u5236\u5f7c\u5973\u304c\u3084\u3063\u3066\u304d\u305f"},{"en":"A Girlfriend Was Forced Upon Me, The Forever Loner"},{"en":"I\u2019m a Loner and My Girlfriend Came to Me by Force"},{"vi":"B\u1ea1n G\u00e1i B\u1ea5t \u0110\u1eafc D\u0129 C\u1ee7a C\u00f4 \u0110\u1ed9c V\u01b0\u01a1ng"}],"description":{"en":"On my 24th birthday, I came home to find a woman who wanted to be my girlfriend! As a \"loner\" since junior high school, I was confused by all this. But the truth is she is my mother's junior at work, and my mother asked her to!? A pseudo-romance between two people with the same interests has begun!","ja":"\u4e2d\u5b66\u6642\u4ee3\u304b\u3089\u201c\u307c\u3063\u3061\u201d\u306a\u5468\u5e73\u306f\u3001\u5fc5\u8981\u4ee5\u4e0a\u306b\u4eba\u3068\u4ea4\u308f\u3089\u305a\u8a71\u3055\u306a\u3044\u3002\u305d\u3093\u306a\u5468\u5e73\u304c24\u6b73\u3092\u8fce\u3048\u305f\u8a95\u751f\u65e5\u3001\u81ea\u5b85\u306e\u98df\u5353\u306b\u898b\u77e5\u3089\u306c\u5973\u6027\u304c\uff01\uff1f","vi":"V\u00e0o sinh nh\u1eadt l\u1ea7n th\u1ee9 24, t\u00f4i v\u1ec1 nh\u00e0 v\u00e0 ph\u00e1t hi\u1ec7n m\u1ed9t c\u00f4 g\u00e1i \u0111ang ch\u1edd m\u00ecnh, c\u00f2n mu\u1ed1n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh b\u1ea1n g\u00e1i c\u1ee7a t\u00f4i!\n\nL\u00e0 m\u1ed9t \u201ck\u1ebb c\u00f4 \u0111\u1ed9c\u201d t\u1eeb h\u1ed3i c\u1ea5p hai, t\u00f4i ch\u1eb3ng bi\u1ebft ph\u1ea3i ph\u1ea3n \u1ee9ng th\u1ebf n\u00e0o tr\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u1ec7n n\u00e0y. Nh\u01b0ng s\u1ef1 th\u1eadt l\u00e0 c\u00f4 \u1ea5y l\u1ea1i l\u00e0 h\u1eadu b\u1ed1i c\u1ee7a m\u1eb9 t\u00f4i \u1edf ch\u1ed7 l\u00e0m, v\u00e0 ch\u00ednh m\u1eb9 t\u00f4i \u0111\u00e3 nh\u1edd c\u00f4 \u1ea5y l\u00e0m v\u1eady!?\n\nM\u1ed9t m\u1ed1i t\u00ecnh gi\u1ea3 gi\u1eefa hai con ng\u01b0\u1eddi c\u00f3 c\u00f9ng s\u1edf th\u00edch ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u!","pt-br":"No meu 24\u00ba anivers\u00e1rio, voltei para casa para encontrar uma mulher que queria ser minha namorada! Como \"solit\u00e1rio\" desde o ensino m\u00e9dio, fiquei confuso com tudo isto, mas a verdade \u00e9 que ela \u00e9 a kohai da minha m\u00e3e no trabalho, e a minha m\u00e3e lhe pediu que o fizesse! Se inicia ent\u00e3o umm pseudo-romance entre duas pessoas com os mesmos interesses!"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"136994","ap":"a-girlfriend-was-forced-upon-me-the-forever-loner","bl":"1047427","bw":"series\/331603\/list","kt":"64340","mu":"jnz4kbu","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/dp\/B0D8HFH3SD","cdj":"https:\/\/www.cdjapan.co.jp\/product\/NEOBK-2675724","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/672453","mal":"141738","raw":"https:\/\/comic-trail.com\/episode\/3269632237330707078","engtl":"https:\/\/mangaplaza.com\/title\/0303005553"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":"seinen","status":"ongoing","year":2021,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"423e2eae-a7a2-4a8b-ac03-a8351462d71d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Romance"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"92d6d951-ca5e-429c-ac78-451071cbf064","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Office Workers"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"b9af3a63-f058-46de-a9a0-e0c13906197a","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Drama"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"e5301a23-ebd9-49dd-a0cb-2add944c7fe9","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Slice of Life"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2021-12-05T03:44:16+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-20T05:03:57+00:00","version":37,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["pt-br","en","es-la","vi","ru"],"latestUploadedChapter":"531f67c6-6703-4585-8015-946397c2abc3"},"relationships":[{"id":"2ab86811-6901-4622-9ac9-59d1b6582c3d","type":"author"},{"id":"2ab86811-6901-4622-9ac9-59d1b6582c3d","type":"artist"},{"id":"a7b7dff2-ae41-46f7-bd3e-5be2184ed9d3","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":"5","fileName":"0ee3a6f2-e443-45b5-acaf-a3a28317b32b.jpg","locale":"ja","createdAt":"2025-04-29T06:55:07+00:00","updatedAt":"2025-04-29T06:55:07+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"5497c58d-d8f9-4f12-ae97-41ceaf738a58","type":"creator"}]},{"id":"1d2967dd-d157-4cbb-84ed-ea7cf7140d14","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Yume de Furarete Hajimaru Yuri"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u5922\u3067\u30d5\u30e9\u308c\u3066\u306f\u3058\u307e\u308b\u767e\u5408"},{"en":"A Yuri Love Story That Begins with Getting Dumped in a Dream"},{"en":"Dumped in a Dream, Girls Love That Begins"},{"zh":"\u4ece\u68a6\u91cc\u88ab\u62d2\u7edd\u5f00\u59cb\u7684\u767e\u5408"},{"fr":"Notre histoire commen\u00e7a lorsque ma confession fut rejet\u00e9e dans mes r\u00eaves"},{"fr":"Notre relation Yuri a commenc\u00e9 lorsque ma confession s'est fait rejeter dans mes r\u00eaves."},{"id":"Kisah Yuri Kita Berawal Dari Diriku yang Ditolak di Dalam Mimpi"}],"description":{"en":"For your very average high school girl, Tsukushi, there's her cool and beautiful childhood friend (with some very particular weaknesses) Hinoka. Tsukushi always thought they would be normal childhood friends forever\u2026 That is until Tsukushi saw Hinoka rejected her confession in a dream.   The hypnagogic romantic comedy between a cheery maiden, and a cool girl which begins with a dream, starts right now!\n\n [Serialization of Popular Twitter manga by Hijiki](https:\/\/mangadex.org\/title\/088db207-6c42-4fa9-9e6f-1b831c21c1ac\/a-yuri-manga-that-starts-with-getting-rejected-in-a-dream)","id":"Tsukushi bermimpi ditolak saat menyatakan cintanya pada sahabatnya, Hinoka. Satu mimpi yang akan selalu menghantuinya, dan membuatnya mulai melihat Hinoka dengan cara yang berbeda.","ja":"\u3069\u3053\u306b\u3067\u3082\u3044\u308b\u